{"level":"cefr-daily","note":"高價值主題例句・日常對話語塊：自寫，待獨立 reviewer 審。","items":[
  {"sentence":"How's it going?","zh":"最近怎麼樣？"},
  {"sentence":"Long time no see.","zh":"好久不見。"},
  {"sentence":"What have you been up to?","zh":"你最近都在忙什麼？"},
  {"sentence":"Catch you later.","zh":"待會見。"},
  {"sentence":"Take care of yourself.","zh":"你自己要保重。"},
  {"sentence":"Can you give me a hand?","zh":"你可以幫我一下嗎？"},
  {"sentence":"Could you say that again?","zh":"可以再說一次嗎？"},
  {"sentence":"Do you mind if I sit here?","zh":"你介意我坐這裡嗎？"},
  {"sentence":"Can I get a glass of water?","zh":"可以給我一杯水嗎？"},
  {"sentence":"Hold on a second.","zh":"稍等一下。"},
  {"sentence":"Let me help you with that.","zh":"我來幫你吧。"},
  {"sentence":"Do you want a ride?","zh":"要我載你一程嗎？"},
  {"sentence":"Go ahead, help yourself.","zh":"別客氣，請自便。"},
  {"sentence":"I'll get it for you.","zh":"我去幫你拿。"},
  {"sentence":"Want me to come along?","zh":"要我陪你一起去嗎？"},
  {"sentence":"Sounds good to me.","zh":"我覺得不錯。"},
  {"sentence":"I couldn't agree more.","zh":"我完全同意。"},
  {"sentence":"I'm not so sure about that.","zh":"這點我不太確定。"},
  {"sentence":"Okay, fair enough.","zh":"好，有道理。"},
  {"sentence":"That works for me.","zh":"這樣我可以。"},
  {"sentence":"What do you mean?","zh":"你是什麼意思？"},
  {"sentence":"Wait, I don't get it.","zh":"等等，我不懂。"},
  {"sentence":"Let me make sure I understand.","zh":"我確認一下我的理解。"},
  {"sentence":"So you're saying no?","zh":"所以你是說不要？"},
  {"sentence":"Can you be more specific?","zh":"你可以講清楚一點嗎？"},
  {"sentence":"Sorry, my bad.","zh":"抱歉，是我的錯。"},
  {"sentence":"I didn't mean to.","zh":"我不是故意的。"},
  {"sentence":"Sorry to keep you waiting.","zh":"抱歉讓你久等了。"},
  {"sentence":"No worries, take your time.","zh":"別擔心，慢慢來。"},
  {"sentence":"It's okay, don't worry about it.","zh":"沒關係，別放在心上。"},
  {"sentence":"Hello, who's this?","zh":"喂，請問哪位？"},
  {"sentence":"Can I call you back?","zh":"我可以晚點回你電話嗎？"},
  {"sentence":"You're breaking up.","zh":"你的聲音斷斷續續的。"},
  {"sentence":"Hang on, let me check.","zh":"等一下，我查查看。"},
  {"sentence":"I'll text you the address.","zh":"我把地址傳給你。"},
  {"sentence":"Are you free this weekend?","zh":"你這週末有空嗎？"},
  {"sentence":"Let's grab lunch sometime.","zh":"我們找時間吃個午餐吧。"},
  {"sentence":"What time works for you?","zh":"你幾點方便？"},
  {"sentence":"I'll meet you there.","zh":"我到那邊跟你會合。"},
  {"sentence":"Let's call it a day.","zh":"今天就到這裡吧。"},
  {"sentence":"No way, really?","zh":"不會吧，真的嗎？"},
  {"sentence":"Wow, that's awesome!","zh":"哇，太棒了！"},
  {"sentence":"Oh, I had no idea.","zh":"喔，我都不知道。"},
  {"sentence":"That makes sense.","zh":"這樣說得通。"},
  {"sentence":"Good for you!","zh":"替你開心！"},
  {"sentence":"It's up to you.","zh":"由你決定。"},
  {"sentence":"Let me think about it.","zh":"讓我想一想。"},
  {"sentence":"I'll get back to you soon.","zh":"我很快回覆你。"},
  {"sentence":"Never mind, it's fine.","zh":"算了，沒事。"},
  {"sentence":"Thanks a lot, I owe you one.","zh":"多謝，我欠你一次。"}
]}
